</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/df7f5d71-6242-4dcf-8914-1d4ab30e2391_1080/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/df7f5d71-6242-4dcf-8914-1d4ab30e2391_1080/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1693251031136_6046" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1693251031136_6046"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Venue Specs</h2><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Capacity</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">150 seated, 450 standing; banquet style upon request</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Facilities</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Bar, dressing room, WiFi, common area restrooms</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Furniture</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">150 IKEA folding chairs</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">10 lightweight trestle tables (36 L x 72 W x 28 H in.)</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">4 moveable walls</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Rental partner vendors available upon request for banquet seating, etc.</p><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Sound &amp; Backline</h2><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Sound &amp; Lighting</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Midas M32 digital mixer with stage box; pre-fader multitrack recording capabilities</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Full-range Meyer Sound system including LINA line arrays (configured in stereo or quad); 2x LFC-900 subwoofers</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">2x DB Technologies DVX-DM28 2 x 8" floor wedges; 2x DB Technologies FMX10 10" mini-wedges</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Projection: Epson Powerlite 2250U Projector; 2x supplemental Epson short-throw projectors</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Lighting: 4x Source Fours (with gels); 4x Hex Par ADJ RGBA; Strobe</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Backline</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Steinway B “Hamburg” Grand Piano</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Drums: Yamaha Stage Custom (23” kick; 16.5” floor; 10.5” rack tom; 12.5” rack tom; 14.5” snare; hardware for 1 hi-hat and 3 cymbals); 20” Zildjian “A” ride</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Amplifiers: Fender Twin Reverb ‘65 (1x15 cabinet); Roland JC-120; Fender Hot Rod Deluxe; Ampeg SVT-3 Pro bass amp w/ Sunn cabinet</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">On-stage mixers &amp; DIs: Mackie 1604 VLZ Pro; Mackie 1202 VLZ4; 4 stereo DIs; 3 mono DIs</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">8 Manhasset music stands</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Microphones</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Instrument mics: 2x Rode NT5; 2x AKG p170; 2x Sennheiser e906; 2x Sennheiser MD421; 2x Shure SM57</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Vocal mics: 2x Sennheiser e8605; 1x Telefunken M80; 1x Shure SM58; 1x Sennheiser Wireless</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Drums: 1x Shure Beta52A; Sennheiser drum mic kit including 4x e604; 2x e614; 1x e602 II</p></div>


  <style>.fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1693251031136_6046 {mix-blend-mode: ;
    }</style>
